    "done_when": "For each followup, and for each of the four repairs inside f-crpc-control-gate-repairs, the report states met, partly met or unmet at main, with the file and line that settles it read from the committed blob at the main revision named on its first line, and the commit that landed anything met. An unmet item carries the smallest reproduction a repair node could start from, run and logged, and each met item carries one executed check showing the behaviour at main. Where another plan has taken an item over, the report names it. The report is at /home/ITER/mcintos/.config/reckon/crew/reports/reckon/s22-coord/crpc-currency/report.md. Nothing in the repository changes. Every pytest process uses a basetemp private to that process. Scratch goes under /tmp in a directory named for this run and is deleted before status complete, printed and listed in artifacts. The turn ends once the manifest reads complete or blocked.",
